+# Wire Format
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) as the wire serialisation format, chosen for its more compact binary representation compared to previous approaches, as part of an ongoing optimization strategy spanning compression, caching, authentication, and transport layers.
